{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b01", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "open", "job": "hook", "delivery": "low and unhurried; a beat of quiet before the question", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.7, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 20, "facts": 1}, "why": "Night, one key light on a lone work login screen in a dark office; the field fills, the screen answers 'Login successful'; slow push in. Dana seen asleep at home in silhouette, a cut away.", "id": "b4c13d57f4ab54ce", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b02", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "open", "job": "orient", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.6, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 17, "facts": 3}, "why": "The password becomes a physical object, a small lit key card, lifted out of the screen into the dark; the camera follows it toward a long corridor of closed doors.", "id": "da4bcd67a08e28bd", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b03", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec1", "job": "scenario", "delivery": "matter of fact, no judgement", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.5, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 15, "facts": 1}, "why": "Rewind: daylight dimmed to evening; the same key card fits two doors side by side, one labelled Shop, one labelled Work. Plain, no blame.", "id": "03b021d7619274b7", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b04", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec1", "job": "sequence", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.8, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 20, "facts": 2}, "why": "The Shop door is forced in shadow off to the side; the key card is copied onto a long sheet of other cards, a list that slides from hand to hand in silhouette. The Work door stays in the dark, untouched.", "id": "bd95710d16cf55bf", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b05", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec1", "job": "define", "delivery": "slower on the term", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.9, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 15, "facts": 2}, "why": "A machine-steady stream of key cards tried against a row of login doors, one after another, automated and indifferent; the term appears once as the stream runs.", "id": "26ab38c16d78d52d", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b06", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec1", "job": "consolidate", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.6, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 9, "facts": 1}, "why": "In the stream, Dana's card reaches the Work door and turns; the door opens a crack and light spills out. Hold on the open door.", "id": "b813174d2ea2573f", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b07", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec2", "job": "relate", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.3, "change_over_time": false}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 14, "facts": 1}, "why": "Inside the office at night, a silhouette at a desk is indistinguishable from an ordinary user; the security camera's view shows nothing unusual.", "id": "a7f79f22dcc12038", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b08", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec2", "job": "define", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.9, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 17, "facts": 2}, "why": "From the first open door, a corridor: one door after another opens in sequence down the line, the light spreading; a last heavier door at the end is tried.", "id": "6e860a67d7895166", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b09", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec2", "job": "check", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.3, "change_over_time": false}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 10, "facts": 1}, "why": "Wide on the corridor of open doors, then the two places the night could have stopped are marked: the first login door, and the moment a correct password is used by someone else. Hold for the viewer to choose.", "id": "ebc82342e2da2551", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b10", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec3", "job": "demonstrate", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.8, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 21, "facts": 2}, "why": "Replay the leak with two different key cards: the Shop card is copied, tried at the Work door, and does not turn. A small password manager vault hands out a fresh card per door.", "id": "36d0501c8feb15db", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b11", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec3", "job": "demonstrate", "delivery": "slower on the term", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.7, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 17, "facts": 1}, "why": "The stolen card turns in the lock, but a second lock below it stays shut, waiting for a code on Dana's phone. The door holds.", "id": "beb2ebbe63bd68ee", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b12", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec3", "job": "refute", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.7, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 20, "facts": 2}, "why": "On a bedside phone in the dark, approval requests light up one after another; the thumb presses Deny. The second lock stays shut.", "id": "85ede43d1b52e232", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b13", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec4", "job": "practice", "delivery": "plain and brisk", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.5, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 19, "facts": 3}, "why": "Morning light edges in: three plain actions appear as objects on Dana's desk, each picked up as it is named: a fresh key card, the phone with MFA on, a report sent to the security team.", "id": "cce0b23a4b917a61", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-cinematic-noir-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b14", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "close", "job": "payoff", "delivery": "warm and quiet; let the last line land", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.7, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 21, "facts": 3}, "why": "The opening shot again, two in the morning, one key light: the leaked card is tried at the Work door and does not turn, the phone lights once, Deny; the corridor of doors stays dark and shut. Slow pull back.", "id": "ffcf2e845c3d001a", "at": "2026-10-14T12:54:52"}
